# Hollowtrunk Grove (CIPlay hollowtrunk_grove): the greenhouse round 0 -40, the water tower -16 -46, the zipline from
# trunk 2 to trunk 4 (-20 28), trunk 4's deck -22 30, the seed store 6 14, the root hole -6 2.
island Hollowtrunk Grove
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Hollow Trees
zone greenhouse
expect step 1
read Seedkeeper's watering rota
expect step 2
open Water tower tank
wait 3
expect step 3
zone trunk_4
expect step 4
open Trunk store
wait 3
expect step 5
open Crown box
wait 3
expect step 6
open Seed store
wait 3
expect step 7
open Seed drawers
wait 2
expect step 8
read Ranger log 6
expect step 9
zone roots
expect done
